        ],
        "text": "According to Scott L. Nelson (Petitioner), according to Scott L. Nelson (Petitioner), the petitioner argues that the Rules Enabling Act governs both diversity and federal question cases."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Scott L. Nelson (Petitioner)",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "2268f733e3d0b10606e25cff8f86fb6f08c5964eda773abc33e5944c292c4123",
